1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,200
When a loved one passes away, families face months of fragmented paperwork,

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,800
uncataloged bank accounts, and opaque succession rules.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:15,000
In India alone, over 1.8 lakh crore rupees sit unclaimed

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,800
because navigating death certificates, legal heirs, and claims is overwhelming.

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Virasat is India's first autonomous estate settlement mesh.

6
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:34,800
It discovers every asset, calculates legal shares deterministically, and prepares claim packets in minutes.

7
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:42,500
Let's enter the live platform as a Judge reviewing the estate of Late Ramesh Sharma,

8
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:49,500
starting directly from raw unindexed documents.

9
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:57,500
A multi-agent mesh ingests municipal death certificates, queries simulated gateways,

10
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:04,500
and constructs the property graph—streaming cited events with bi-temporal hashes.

11
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:11,500
In under twenty seconds, Virasat locates twelve distinct assets

12
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:17,800
totaling 2.84 crore rupees with complete institutional reconciliation.

13
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:23,500
The bi-temporal kinship engine exposes what was true in the real world

14
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:27,800
versus what institutions recorded—surfacing a historic HDFC nominee discrepancy.

15
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:32,500
Legal shares are calculated using a zero-LLM deterministic rules engine

16
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:35,800
under Section 8 of the Hindu Succession Act, citing exact clauses.

17
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:39,800
Claims Packager generates compliant packets tailored to SBI, IRDAI, and EPFO standards,

18
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,800
complete with indemnity bonds and statutory notices.

19
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,800
Dispute Guard intercepts conflicting Class-II caveats,

20
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,800
while multilingual voice assistance guides heirs in Hindi and Telugu.

21
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:56,500
Under the hood, Virasat is built on Google Cloud.

22
00:01:56,800 --> 00:02:02,500
Cloud Spanner houses relational tables and the bi-temporal property graph.

23
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:07,800
Vertex AI Gemini 2.5 Flash powers multimodal parsing, while Gemini 2.5 Pro drives legal reasoning.

24
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:14,000
Crucially, legal shares never use LLM math. A deterministic engine computes shares,

25
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:19,500
every explanation cites statutory clauses verified against Spanner,

26
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:24,500
and all mutations are sealed in a hash-chained audit log.

27
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:31,500
In empirical evaluations across thirty golden legal benchmarks, Virasat achieved 100% share accuracy,

28
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:37,800
100% defect recall, and an end-to-end execution cost of just 1.5 cents per estate.

29
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:44,500
Virasat empowers families and financial institutions to settle estates with transparency, dignity, and care.

30
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:49,500
Experience the live platform today at virasat-511210.web.app.
